WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.125
Let's export the address book from your own Yahoo Mail account.

2
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:08.208
On a computer, sign in to your Yahoo Mail account.

3
00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:12.292
Choose Contacts to see the people saved in your address book.

4
00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:19.708
Open More options, then choose Export to CSV file. Classic Mail may call it Export CSV.

5
00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:26.750
Keep the downloaded CSV where you can find it. This exports contacts, not your inbox.

6
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:33.458
In Gold Mine Genie, choose the CSV in Import Studio and review the matches before adding contacts.
